  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Target:</strong> A magic item</p>\n<p>You alter the properties of a magic item. When you place the sabotage, you can choose for it to have a mishap the next time it is activated or when it is activated in a clear, observable circumstance you define. Instead of the intended effect, the item produces the effect of one of your (mishap) talents. This hack then ends.</p>\n<p>You cannot use this talent to sabotage more items at once than your operative ability modifier; sabotaging another ends another sabotage of yours chosen at random.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat:</strong> Sabotage Magic Item (Pathfinder Roleplaying Game: Ultimate Intrigue).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
